# Sign-in API, checked by hand against a running service on http://localhost:8080.
#
# Before: the database migrated (task migrate:up) and the first user created from
# HT_BOOTSTRAP_EMAIL, HT_BOOTSTRAP_NAME and HT_BOOTSTRAP_PASSWORD of .env
# (task user:create-first).
#
# The requests below run in an HTTP client that reads .env (VS Code REST Client) and keeps
# the cookies between requests. The same scenario with curl, from the repository root:
#
# $ set -a; . ./.env; set +a; jar="$(mktemp)"
# $ curl -sS -o /dev/null -w 'login %{http_code}\n' -c "$jar" -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login -H 'Origin: http://localhost:8080' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d "{\"email\":\"$HT_BOOTSTRAP_EMAIL\",\"password\":\"$HT_BOOTSTRAP_PASSWORD\"}"
# $ curl -sS -w '\nme %{http_code}\n' -b "$jar" http://localhost:8080/api/me
# $ curl -sS -o /dev/null -w 'change password %{http_code}\n' -b "$jar" -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/me/password -H 'Origin: http://localhost:8080' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d "{\"currentPassword\":\"$HT_BOOTSTRAP_PASSWORD\",\"newPassword\":\"$HT_BOOTSTRAP_PASSWORD\"}"
# $ curl -sS -w '\nwrong current password %{http_code}\n' -b "$jar" -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/me/password -H 'Origin: http://localhost:8080' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{"currentPassword":"not the password","newPassword":"whatever password"}'
# $ cp "$jar" "$jar.before-logout"
# $ curl -sS -o /dev/null -w 'logout %{http_code}\n' -b "$jar" -c "$jar" -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/logout -H 'Origin: http://localhost:8080'
# $ curl -sS -w '\nme after logout %{http_code}\n' -b "$jar" http://localhost:8080/api/me
# $ curl -sS -w '\nold cookie after logout %{http_code}\n' -b "$jar.before-logout" http://localhost:8080/api/me
# $ curl -sS -w '\nwrong password %{http_code}\n' -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login -H 'Origin: http://localhost:8080' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d "{\"email\":\"$HT_BOOTSTRAP_EMAIL\",\"password\":\"not the password\"}"
# $ rm -f "$jar" "$jar.before-logout"
#
# Expected: login 204, me 200 with the user, change password 204 (to the same password),
# wrong current password 400 wrong_current_password, logout 204, me after logout 401
# unauthenticated, the cookie kept from before logout 401 as well (the session is closed),
# wrong password 401 invalid_credentials.

@host = http://localhost:8080
@origin = http://localhost:8080

### Sign in: 204 and Set-Cookie ht_session
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "{{$dotenv HT_BOOTSTRAP_EMAIL}}", "password": "{{$dotenv HT_BOOTSTRAP_PASSWORD}}"}

### The signed-in user: 200 {id, email, name}
GET {{host}}/api/me

### Change the password: 204; 400 wrong_current_password, password_too_short or password_too_long
POST {{host}}/api/me/password
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"currentPassword": "{{$dotenv HT_BOOTSTRAP_PASSWORD}}", "newPassword": "{{$dotenv HT_BOOTSTRAP_PASSWORD}}"}

### Sign out: 204, the cookie is deleted and the session closed
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{origin}}

### After sign-out: 401 unauthenticated
GET {{host}}/api/me
